2028 0 obj
  << /ActualText (PRIV6\055SHIELD is a privacy\055aware\054 web\055based IPv6 IoT security monitoring system designed to detect network threats while avoiding permanent device tracking\056\nIsolated IPv6 IoT Network\072 Create one local IPv6 LAN containing five emulated IoT devices and a legitimate IPv6 router\056     PS\055007\nPrivacy\055Preserving Identity\072 Replace permanent device identifiers with short\055lived local pseudonyms that automatically expire\056\nIPv6 Address Rotation\072 Allow IoT devices to periodically change their IPv6 addresses while maintaining authenticated local sessions\056\nReal\055Time Monitoring\072 Capture and analyze IPv6 and ICMPv6 traffic locally using a monitoring pipeline\056\nRogue Router Detection\072 Identify unauthorized Router Advertisement messages and generate high\055severity security alerts\056\nNDP Anomaly Detection\072 Establish normal Neighbor Discovery traffic levels and detect abnormal message\055rate increases\056     PS\055007\nLocal Event Correlation\072 Correlate address rotations\054 sessions\054 NDP activity\054 and security events locally without relying on permanent cross\055device tracking\056\nWeb\055Based Security Dashboard\072 Provide live network topology\054 device\057session status\054 IPv6 activity\054 alerts\054 address rotations\054 and privacy status\056\nPrivacy Verification\072 Verify pseudonym expiration and ensure that cross\055tenant correlation and permanent identity recovery are not performed\056     PS\055007\nPerformance Evaluation\072 Measure detection rate\054 false positives\054 attack detection\054 address\055rotation handling\054 and privacy\055related outcomes\056\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 2029 0 R
     /Pg 980 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

