2060 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The PRIV6\055SHIELD deployment will be completed in a 14\055day phased development plan\056 During Days 1\0232\054 the team will prepare the Linux environment\054 configure the legitimate IPv6 router\054 and create the isolated IPv6 IoT network\056 Days 2\0233 will focus on creating and connecting five emulated IoT devices\056 During Days 3\0234\054 IPv6\054 ICMPv6\054 and Neighbour Discovery traffic monitoring will be implemented using packet\055capture tools\056 Days 4\0236 will develop short\055lived pseudonyms\054 authenticated sessions\054 and IPv6 address\055rotation mechanisms\056 Days 6\0238 will implement rogue Router Advertisement detection\054 abnormal NDP\055rate detection\054 and local event correlation\056 Days 8\02310 will integrate the FastAPI backend\054 local storage\054 real\055time communication\054 and web\055based security dashboard\056 Days 10\02312 will test normal traffic\054 address rotation\054 rogue Router Advertisements\054 and NDP anomalies while optimizing detection and reducing false positives\056 Days 12\02313 will evaluate detection performance and privacy requirements\056 Day 14 will complete system integration\054 documentation\054 presentation materials\054 and the final live demonstration\056\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 2061 0 R
     /Pg 1714 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

